1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,450
1871 年，法国刚输掉一场战争。
1871. France has just lost a war.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:09,600
阿尔萨斯-洛林，从此归了新成立的德意志帝国。
Alsace-Lorraine now belongs to the new German Empire.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,100
那里的人一步也没挪，变的是他们的证件。
The people there never moved an inch. Their papers did.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:23,400
1918 年，德国输了下一场战争，法国又把它撕了回来。
In 1918, Germany lost the next war, and France tore it right back off.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,900
1940 年，纳粹德国又把它夺走。没有条约，只靠武力。
In 1940, Nazi Germany took it again. No treaty this time. Just force.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,200
到 1945 年，它又回到了法国。
By 1945, it was French again.

7
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,280
四层纸，一辈子。
Four layers. One lifetime.

8
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:46,160
她一辈子没搬过家，家却换了四次国家。
She never moved house. Her home switched countries four times.

9
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:50,000
今天，斯特拉斯堡是欧洲议会的所在地。
Today, Strasbourg hosts the European Parliament.

